    "Royal is now the strongest shield specialist and has meaningful reasons to be present in group PvP, raids, sieges, and pet-oriented groups. Its best power is coordinated rather than purely personal.": "王族現在是最強的盾牌專家，在團體 PvP、突襲、攻城與寵物導向的隊伍裡都有實質的存在理由。它最強的力量來自協同，而不是純粹的個人能力。",
    "Knight remains the simplest durable melee class, but Reborn gives its control and one-handed builds clearer scaling.": "騎士仍然是最單純、最耐打的近戰職業，但 Reborn 讓它的控制與單手配置有更清楚的成長。",
