    "Shield-using Elves receive half of the Royal shield hit and half-hit proc chance, but do not receive the Royal’s passive shield DR bonus.": "使用盾牌的妖精獲得王族盾牌命中與減半攻擊觸發機率的一半，但沒有王族的被動盾牌 DR 加成。",
    "Top original CON, DEX, and WIS bonuses remain active above their stock exact-value breakpoints.": "最高級的初始 CON、DEX、WIS 加成，超過原版精確門檻後仍然有效。",
