    "Above 25 INT, the roll gains one additional effective die per 8.5 INT, including fractional progress rather than waiting only for a full breakpoint.": "INT 超過 25 後，每 8.5 點 INT 多一顆有效骰，含小數進度，不必等到整數門檻。",
